 "notes": [
  "Starting cards as posted under 'Start(6)': Quiet Mining Colony / Independent Operation ('QMC/Independant Operation'), Bespin, Cloud City: Guest Quarters, Heading For The Medical Frigate ('HFTMF'), Squadron Assignments ('Squassin') and Keeping The Empire Out Forever ('Keepin out da Empire'); these count toward the 60.",
  "The starting section also has a '<Your Choice>' line (the third Heading For The Medical Frigate effect, not counted in 'Start(6)'); it names no card, so no row is added. The Interrupts header says 13 but 12 are listed; the named cards total 60.",
  "Posted 'ECC Lando' dested Lando With Blaster Pistol (the Enhanced Cloud City Lando); 'Qui-gon's Saber' dested Qui-Gon Jinn's Lightsaber (Tatooine; Qui-Gon's Lightsaber is Reflections III, after this post); 'Path x2' dested Path Of Least Resistance; 'Your Insight' dested Your Insight Serves You Well; 'Honor' dested Honor Of The Jedi; 'Squassin' dested Squadron Assignments.",
  "Posted 'CCDown Town Plaza', 'CCEast Platform (DB)' and 'TatDB' dested Cloud City: Downtown Plaza, Cloud City: East Platform (Docking Bay) and Tatooine: Docking Bay 94 (the strategy pulls Ben and Beggar with the Tatooine docking bay).",
  "The description says 'post coruscant tatooine'; the author's edit says it should read 'POST CORUSCANT QMC'.",
  "Posted 'CCEast Platform (DB)': Cloud City: East Platform (Docking Bay) is a Dark site, kept as posted (it is left out of the GEMP file)."
